      "text": "Mutation results:\ndelete list of files => file\nnot found || files deleted\nupload file => file (parnet)\nnot found || file name\ntaken || file uploaded\ncreate file => file (parent)\nnot found || file name\ntaken|| file created\nmove file => file not found\n|| file moved\nrename file => file name\nalready taken || file\nrenamed\ncopy file => file not exist ?\nfile copied : (overwrite ?\nfile copied : file not copied)\ncreate folder => file\n(parent) not found || file\nname taken || folder\ncreated",
